# UI build artifacts
# `npm run build:web` writes the bundle the control plane embeds here; it is
# packaged for crates.io via did-hosting-control's `include` list, which is why
# `cargo publish` for that crate needs `--allow-dirty`.
did-hosting-control/ui-dist/
webvh-ui/dist/
webvh-ui/node_modules/
webvh-ui/.expo/

# Setup / VTA bootstrap artifacts (generated by setup + vta-request flows)
**/bootstrap-request.json
**/bootstrap-seed.bin
**/setup-offline-state.toml
**/bundle.armor
**/*.armor
**/sealed-export.txt
**/*-did.jsonl

# Secrets and credentials
.env
.env.*
